  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.08 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Advisory Board of Body Art Practitioners",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.08 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Advisory Board of Body Art Practitioners. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.8, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the executive director with the advisory board of body art practitioners under RSA 314-A:\n\nTable 1002.8 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Executive Director with the Body Art Advisory Committee\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nBody art apprentice license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial or renewal | 2 years | $121\n\nBody art personal license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $121\n\nMicroblading certificate application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certificate | 2 years | $121\n\nSource. #13335, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-26-22\n\nNew. #13420, eff 8-8-22; ss by #13703, eff 8-1-23 (formerly Plc 1002.07); ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
